  "evidence": "TEXT_D: Massive NHS capacity and pay boosts; free dental/eye checks; end charges for long‑term personal care; reduce/abolish prescription charges; 6,000 extra police with independent complaints system; focus prisons on rehabilitation and community sentences; Equality Act and Commission; abolish university tuition fees and restore grants; humane, faster asylum system; repeal Section 28; electoral reform (AV+/STV), stronger FOI, more devolution, and EU/euro integration. TEXT_F: Patient’s Guarantee with choice of NHS/private if waits breached; restore ward sister/matron authority; more police, tougher sentencing, and secure training places; asylum reception centres until decisions; increase basic pension and raise pensioner personal allowance; family‑focused tax reliefs; ‘Can Work, Must Work’ welfare with provider payment by results; tax cuts/deregulation and anti‑fraud measures; keep the pound, strengthen NATO ties, maintain independent nuclear deterrent; English Votes for English Laws and strengthen Lords.",
